  "problemStatement": "Find the foci, vertices, and asymptotes of x^2/16 - y^2/9 = 1.",
  "finalAnswer": "\\text{Vertices}: (\\pm 4, 0), \\quad \\text{Foci}: (\\pm 5, 0), \\quad \\text{Asymptotes}: y = \\pm \\frac{3}{4}x",
